        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/ad7895/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2023-08-17T07:41:40.506Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi there,</p>\n<p>Me and my group created two advanced level guides for spirit combos to beat the game above level 20. They are both long and detailed, mostly meant for those who are stuck at level 9-13 like we were for a while but playing these spirits together may also help newer players to get to higher levels than on what they usually play.<br>\nBeating opponents at level 15 for example is pretty easy using the guides below and you may get a kick out of seeing strong opponents suffer and learn new stuff about the game in the meantime <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Have fun!</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/3027281/how-win-past-level-20-loooong-guide-unbeatable-spi\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7781590cc6c86a8a5bb919bea0829edac3b19646.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/3027281/how-win-past-level-20-loooong-guide-unbeatable-spi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">BoardGameGeek</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:445/444;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/74a2dd462386586e93f8b1dd99a76e5bb262e1fc.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"445\" height=\"444\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/3027281/how-win-past-level-20-loooong-guide-unbeatable-spi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">How to win past level 20? - A loooong guide to an unbeatable spirit-combo |...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>We have been trying for some time to beat very high difficulties of Spirit Island but we could never go above 13-14 level. Now, we played with a certain combination of spirits for a while and today we did what I would consider the highest possible...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/3125660/how-win-past-level-twenty-20-eldritch-horror-islan\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7781590cc6c86a8a5bb919bea0829edac3b19646.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/3125660/how-win-past-level-twenty-20-eldritch-horror-islan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">BoardGameGeek</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:445/444;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/74a2dd462386586e93f8b1dd99a76e5bb262e1fc.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"445\" height=\"444\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/3125660/how-win-past-level-twenty-20-eldritch-horror-islan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">How to win past level twenty 2.0. - Eldritch Horror Island | Spirit Island</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Ever since we created our wombo-combo to beat maximum (27) difficulty in Spirit Island (described [thread=3027281]here[/thread]) we have been trying to come up with something effective that does not include the spirits used there but can still rise...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2023-08-17T07:42:17.969Z",
